<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερῶ</span></b>  serving as fut., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διείρηκα</span></b>  as pf., of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγορεύω </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεῖπον</span> (q. v.), being
			aor.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>say fully, distinctly, expressly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				809e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διείρηκεν ὁ νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					20.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.72
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερρήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					932e
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διείρημαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				813a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διειρημένον</span>”
				<i>it having been expressly stated,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					17.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
